            'them the new section 26 of 7+1.nb, which computes every worked example), which results of the earlier sections and which data were '
            'used and where they come from, how each result was derived, and how it was checked: the %d checks of section 26 (%d True), the %d '
            'boolean checks of the independent Python program tools/ref_radion.py (%d True), the comparison of the %d groups of numbers printed by '
            'both programs, the check that the earlier sections of the notebook are unchanged, the program versions and the SHA-256 hashes of the '
