          '$f_\\mu=\\sqrt{24M_5^3/k}$, $M_{\\rm Pl}^2=(M_5^3/k)(1-e^{-2k\\pi\\langle T\\rangle})$, the TeV-scale vacuum value and coupling;',
          'an eight-dimensional explanation for students with $n=4$: the values $\\alpha=-1/\\sqrt3$ and $\\beta=1/\\sqrt{12}$, the action $S_{\\rm eff}=\\int\\sqrt{-g}[\\frac{M_{\\rm Pl}^2}2R-\\frac12(\\partial\\phi)^2]$, '
          'and the volume $V_{\\rm phys}=V_{\\rm baseline}e^{(2/\\sqrt3)\\phi}$;',
          'a Goldberger–Wise stabilization in eight dimensions: the potential $V(\\phi)=\\int d^4y\\sqrt\\gamma\\,e^{4\\beta\\phi}\\,u$ with the density $u=\\frac12e^{-2\\beta\\phi}(\\nabla_y\\Phi)^2+\\frac12m_8^2\\Phi^2$, '
          'the mass $m_{\\rm radion}^2=V\'\'(\\phi_0)$, the estimate $m_{\\rm radion}\\sim(m_8/M_8)^2M_{4D}$ and the Yukawa force $F\\propto e^{-m_{\\rm radion}r}/r^2$;',
          'a warped eight-dimensional metric $ds^2=e^{-2A(y)T(x)}g-T(x)^2\\gamma_{ij}dy^idy^j$ with the equations $3A\'\'+6A\'^2=-\\kappa_8^2\\Lambda_8$, $6A\'^2=-\\kappa_8^2\\Lambda_8$, '
          'the solution $A=k|y|$, the tensions $\\lambda_A=-\\lambda_B=6k/\\kappa_8^2$;',
          'the Israel junction conditions $[K_{\\mu\\nu}-\\hat g_{\\mu\\nu}K]^+_-=\\kappa_8^2S_{\\mu\\nu}$, $S_{\\mu\\nu}=-\\lambda\\hat g_{\\mu\\nu}$, $K^\\pm_{\\mu\\nu}=\\mp k\\hat g_{\\mu\\nu}$, ending with '
          '$\\lambda_{\\rm UV}=-6k/\\kappa_8^2$, $\\lambda_{\\rm IR}=+6k/\\kappa_8^2$;',
          'the radion as the distance between the branes: $S_8=\\frac1{2\\kappa_8^2}\\int d^4x\\int_0^\\pi dy\\sqrt{-\\hat g}\\hat R_8$, '
          '$S_{\\rm eff}=\\frac1{2\\kappa_8^2}\\int\\sqrt{-g}[\\frac1k(1-e^{-2k\\pi T})R_4+\\frac6k\\partial(e^{-k\\pi T})\\partial(e^{-k\\pi T})]$, $f_\\mu=\\sqrt{12/(\\kappa_8^2k)}$, '
