          'the Goldberger–Wise mechanism in the warped model: $\\Phi\'\'-4k\\Phi\'-m^2\\Phi=0$, $\\Phi=e^{2ky}(C_1e^{\\nu ky}+C_2e^{-\\nu ky})$, $\\nu=\\sqrt{4+m^2/k^2}\\approx2+\\epsilon$, '
          '$\\epsilon=m^2/(4k^2)$, $V(T)\\approx k\\epsilon v_A^2+4ke^{-4k\\pi T}(v_B-v_Ae^{-\\epsilon k\\pi T})^2$, $k\\pi\\langle T\\rangle\\approx(4k^2/m^2)\\ln(v_A/v_B)$, and the radion '
