    d.h1('6. Derivations')
    d.p('**Einstein frame.** Under $g\\to\\Omega^2g$ in four dimensions $\\sqrt{|g|}\\to\\Omega^4\\sqrt{|g|}$ and $R\\to\\Omega^{-2}R$. For the blocks $e^{2\\alpha}g$ and '
        '$e^{2\\beta}\\gamma$ ($n$ extra dimensions) the term $\\sqrt{|G|}R[G]$ contains $e^{4\\alpha}e^{n\\beta}e^{-2\\alpha}\\sqrt{|g|}\\sqrt\\gamma R[g]$, constant iff $2\\alpha+n\\beta=0$; '
        'for $n=4$: $\\alpha=-2\\beta$, the factor $e^{-4\\beta}$.')
    d.p('**The kinetic coefficient.** With the ansatz $G=\\mathrm{diag}(N^2e^{-n\\beta},-a^2e^{-n\\beta}\\cdot1_3,-e^{2\\beta}\\cdot1_n)$ (per unit coordinate volume of $T^n$), the reduction has the form')
    d.eq(r"-\frac1{2\kappa}\sqrt{|G|}R=-\frac1{2\kappa}Na^3R_E+\frac1{2\kappa}\,c_n\,\frac{a^3\beta'^2}N+\text{(total derivative)},")
    d.p('and the coefficient is SOLVED from the Euler–Lagrange expression for $N$ (it enters linearly): $c_n=n(n+2)/2$, i.e. $\\frac32$, $4$, $\\frac{15}2$, '
        '$12$ for $n=1,\\dots,4$. With $\\beta=\\beta_n\\varphi$ the kinetic term is $\\frac{M_{\\rm Pl}^2}2c_n\\beta_n^2(\\partial\\varphi)^2$: the note’s $\\beta_n^2=2/(n(n+2))$ gives '
        '$c_n\\beta_n^2=1$, the form with $\\frac12$ needs $\\beta_n^2=1/(n(n+2))$. For $n=4$: $6M_{\\rm Pl}^2(\\partial\\beta)^2=\\frac12(\\partial\\phi)^2$ with $\\phi=\\sqrt{12}M_{\\rm Pl}\\beta$.')
    d.p('**The potential.** $\\sqrt{|G|}=e^{-4\\beta}\\sqrt{|g_E|}\\sqrt\\gamma$, and the internal block $-e^{2\\beta}\\gamma$ contributes $-e^{-2\\beta}R_{\\rm int}[\\gamma]$ to $R$ in the '
        'signature of 7+1.nb. Hence $-\\frac1{2\\kappa}\\int\\sqrt{|G|}(R+2\\Lambda)-\\int\\sqrt{|G|}U\\supset\\sqrt{|g_E|}e^{-4\\beta}[\\frac{V_0}{2\\kappa}R_{\\rm int}(\\beta)-M_{\\rm Pl}^2\\Lambda-V_0U]=-\\sqrt{|g_E|}V(\\beta)$ with')
    d.eq(r"V(\beta)=e^{-4\beta}\Big[M_{\rm Pl}^2\Lambda+V_0U-\frac{M_{\rm Pl}^2}2R_{\rm int}\Big],\qquad R_{\rm int}(S^4)=\frac{12}{r_0^2e^{2\beta}},\qquad m_r^2=\frac{V''(0)}{12M_{\rm Pl}^2}.")
    d.p('**The four cases.** With $U=U_0+U_1\\beta+\\frac{K_U}2\\beta^2$ and $V=M_{\\rm Pl}^2[e^{-4\\beta}(\\Lambda+\\kappa U)-6\\sigma e^{-6\\beta}/r_0^2+Fe^{-12\\beta}]$, the conditions '
        '$V(0)=V\'(0)=0$ and $V\'\'(0)$ give: $T^4$ ($\\sigma=F=0$): $\\Lambda+\\kappa U_0=0$, $U_1=0$, $m_r^2=\\kappa K_U/12$; $S^4$ with $U$: $(\\Lambda+\\kappa U_0)r_0^2=6$, '
        '$\\kappa U_1r_0^2=-12$, $V\'\'(0)=M_{\\rm Pl}^2(\\kappa K_U-24/r_0^2)$, $m_r^2=\\kappa K_U/12-2/r_0^2$; $S^4$ with $\\Lambda$ only: $V\'(0)=0\\Rightarrow\\Lambda r_0^2=9$, $V(0)=3M_{\\rm Pl}^2/r_0^2$, '
        '$H^2=1/r_0^2$, $V\'\'(0)=-72M_{\\rm Pl}^2/r_0^2$, $m^2=-6H^2$; $S^4$ with flux: $\\Lambda-6/r_0^2+F=0$ and $-4\\Lambda+36/r_0^2-12F=0$ give $Fr_0^2=\\frac32$, $\\Lambda r_0^2=\\frac92$, '
        '$V\'\'(0)=72M_{\\rm Pl}^2/r_0^2$, $m^2=6/r_0^2$. The eight-dimensional radion equation $\\beta\'\'+3H_a\\beta\'+4\\beta\'^2=\\kappa(\\frac\\varepsilon6-\\frac{p_a}2+\\frac{p_b}3)+\\frac\\Lambda3-\\frac{3\\sigma}{b^2}$ '
        'reproduces each: its right-hand side vanishes at $\\beta=0$ and its derivative is $-m^2$.')
    d.p('**The coupling and the fifth force.** On the brane $h=e^{-4\\beta}g_E$, so $-M\\int d\\tau=-M\\int e^{-2\\beta}dx_0$ and the linear term is $2M\\beta=M\\phi/(\\sqrt3M_{\\rm Pl})$. '
        'A scalar with coupling $g$ gives $-g^2MM\'/(4\\pi r)=-2g^2M_{\\rm Pl}^2\\,G_4MM\'/r$ ($8\\pi G_4=M_{\\rm Pl}^{-2}$), so $\\alpha=2(gM_{\\rm Pl})^2=\\frac23$. The '
        'Eöt-Wash bound gives $m_r>\\hbar c/38.6\\,\\mu{\\rm m}=1.973269804\\times10^{-7}\\,{\\rm eV\\,m}/3.86\\times10^{-5}\\,{\\rm m}$.')
    d.p('**Levels.** On $S^4$, $N=\\sum_{l\\le L}d_l=(L+1)(L+2)^2(L+3)/12=y^2(y^2-1)/12$ with $y=L+2$; for integer $x=\\mu r>2$ the largest $l$ with '
        '$l(l+3)\\le x^2$ is $L=x-2$ (since $(x-2)(x+1)\\le x^2<(x-1)(x+2)$), so $N/(x^4/12)-1=-1/x^2$. The zonal harmonic: '
        '$\\int_{S^4}(C_l/C_l(1))^2=V/d_l$ (checked for $l\\le6$), so $Z_l(0)=\\sqrt{d_l/V}$.')
    d.p('**Killing spinors.** With $\\tilde\\gamma_a=i\\rho_{a+3}$ Hermitian and the frame $e^a$, the spinor $\\varepsilon_s$ of the document satisfies '
        '$\\nabla_i\\varepsilon_s=s\\frac i{2r}e_i{}^a\\tilde\\gamma_a\\varepsilon_s$ identically (checked exactly after writing all angles as twice half-angles); then '
        '$\\not D\\varepsilon_s=s\\frac{2i}r\\varepsilon_s$, saturating $|\\lambda|^2\\ge nR_{\\rm int}/(4(n-1))=4/r^2$.')
    d.p('**RS1.** For $ds^2=e^{-2A}\\eta-dy^2$: $G^\\mu{}_\\nu=3A\'\'-6A\'^2$, $G^y{}_y=-6A\'^2$. $A=k|y|$: $A\'\'=2k\\delta(y)$ at the UV brane; the $\\delta$ part '
        '$6k\\delta(y)\\delta^\\mu_\\nu=\\kappa f\\delta(y)\\delta^\\mu_\\nu$ gives $f_{\\rm UV}=6k/\\kappa$. With $K^\\mu{}_\\nu=\\frac12g^{\\mu\\alpha}\\partial_yg_{\\alpha\\nu}=-A\'\\delta^\\mu_\\nu$: '
        '$[K^\\mu{}_\\nu]-\\delta^\\mu_\\nu[K]=-[A\']+4[A\']=3[A\']=6k$, equal to the $\\delta$ part of $G^\\mu{}_\\nu$; in the signature $(-,+,+,+,+)$ $G^A{}_B$ changes sign, '
        'so there $[K_{\\mu\\nu}-\\hat g_{\\mu\\nu}K]=-\\kappa S_{\\mu\\nu}$. $M_{\\rm Pl}^2=\\frac1\\kappa\\int_{-\\pi R}^{\\pi R}e^{-2k|y|}dy$. For $ds^2=e^{-2kT|y|}g-T^2dy^2$ the bulk Lagrangian, '
        'integrated over $y$, is $c_2(T)T\'\'+\\dots$; subtracting the total derivative $(c_2T\')\'$ leaves $\\frac3{\\kappa k}(\\partial e^{-k\\pi T})^2$, and '
        '$\\frac12f^2=\\frac3{\\kappa k}$.')
    d.p('**Goldberger–Wise.** $L=e^{-4ky}(-\\frac12\\Phi\'^2-\\frac12m^2\\Phi^2)$ gives $e^{-4ky}(\\Phi\'\'-4k\\Phi\'-m^2\\Phi)=0$; the roots of $\\lambda^2-4k\\lambda-m^2=0$ are '
        '$k(2\\pm\\nu)$. For $V=\\frac{4k}{f^4}\\mu^4W^2$, $W=v_B-v_A(\\mu/f)^\\epsilon$: $V\'=\\frac{4k}{f^4}(4\\mu^3W^2+2\\mu^4WW\')$ vanishes at $W=0$; there '
        '$V\'\'=\\frac{8k}{f^4}\\mu^4W\'^2$ with $W\'=-\\epsilon v_B/\\mu$, so $V\'\'=8k\\epsilon^2v_B^2\\mu^2/f^4$, and with $f^2=6/(\\kappa k)$: $\\frac43\\kappa k^2\\epsilon^2v_B^2(\\mu/f)^2$.')
    d.p('**Higgs–radion.** For $h=\\Omega^2\\eta$ in four dimensions, $\\sqrt{|h|}R(h)=-6\\Omega\\Box\\Omega$ (computed). With $\\Omega=1+o_1r+o_2r^2$ and $\\varphi_H=v+h$, the '
        'curvature term $\\frac\\xi2(-6\\Omega\\Box\\Omega)\\varphi_H^2$ has the quadratic part $-3\\xi(v^2o_1^2r\\Box r+2vo_1h\\Box r)$ plus total derivatives ($o_2$ enters only as '
        '$\\Box(r^2)$); integrating by parts gives $3\\xi\\gamma^2(\\partial r)^2+6\\xi\\gamma\\,\\partial h\\cdot\\partial r$ ($\\gamma=vo_1$). $S^{\\mathsf T}KS=1$ requires '
        '$(K_{rr}-36\\xi^2\\gamma^2)/Z^2=1$. In $Q^{\\mathsf T}M\'Q$ the off-diagonal element is $-\\frac12(M\'_{11}-M\'_{22})\\sin2\\theta+M\'_{12}\\cos2\\theta$.')

    # ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    d.h1('7. Verification')
    lg = D.get('log', {})
    d.h2('7.1 The checks of section 26 of 7+1.nb')
    d.p('**Evaluation of 7+1.nb**: Wolfram %s, %s; finished %s; %s s; message cells %s; output cells %s. The checks of section 26:' % (
        lg.get('version', '15.0.1'), lg.get('kernel', ''), lg.get('finished', '?'), lg.get('seconds', '?'), lg.get('message cells', '?'),
        lg.get('output cells', '?')))
    d.table(['#', 'check', 'result', 'section'],
            [[str(i + 1), '`' + c[0].replace('`', "'") + '`', c[1], (c[3][:4] if c[3] else c[2][:3])] for i, c in enumerate(ck)],
            widths=[0.055, 0.745, 0.08, 0.12], small=True)
    d.h2('7.2 The independent Python program')
    d.p('tools/ref_radion.py — its boolean checks:')
    d.table(['#', 'check', 'result'], [[str(i + 1), '`' + k.replace('`', "'") + '`', v] for i, (k, v) in enumerate(rb)],
            widths=[0.055, 0.825, 0.12], small=True)
    d.p('**Numbers printed by both programs** (largest relative difference per group, and the tolerance used by tools/verify_7p1_nb.py; integers '
        'must agree exactly):')
    rows = []
    for lab, a, b, tol, r in cmp_:
        rows.append([lab, str(len(a)), fmt(r, 2) if r is not None else '—', fmt(tol, 1) if tol else 'exact'])
    d.table(['quantity', 'values', 'max. relative difference', 'tolerance'], rows, widths=[0.52, 0.1, 0.22, 0.16], small=True)
    d.h2('7.3 The earlier sections are unchanged')
    sl = stage7_lines(runs)
    if sl:
        d.p('tools/verify_7p1_nb.py compares the evaluated notebook with the backup of section 4 and with the Python program; its lines on section 26:')
        d.code('\n'.join(' '.join(l.split()) for l in sl), 'text')
    else:
        d.p('tools/verify_7p1_nb.py compares the evaluated notebook with the backup of section 4 and with the Python program (its output is not '
            'available to this build).')
    d.h2('7.4 Files')
    d.p('**SHA-256 of the files** (at the time this document was generated):')
    d.code('\n'.join('%-34s %s' % (f, h) for f, h in D.get('sha', {}).items()), 'text')
    for title, out, *rest in (runs or []):
        if 'ref_radion' in title:
            d.p('**Output of %s** (complete):' % title)
            d.code(out, 'text')
    return d
